{"id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#cor:dc-ch8-2-3","title":"cor:dc-ch8-2-3","path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature.md","line":490,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature.tex#cor:dc-ch8-2-3","uses":["[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-transfer-const]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-velocity-frame]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-norm-transfer]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-const-solution]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-equiv]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-local-diffeo]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-polarization]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-mfderiv-bridge]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-diff-zero]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-zero]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-ball]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer-mfderiv]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-2-semiconjugacy]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#cor:dc-ch8-2-2]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature.tex","label":"cor:dc-ch8-2-3","line":1299,"source":"\\begin{corollary}[Local frame transitivity]\n  \\label{cor:dc-ch8-2-3}\n\n  \\uses{lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-transfer-const, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-velocity-frame, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-norm-transfer, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-const-solution, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-equiv, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-local-diffeo, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-polarization, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-mfderiv-bridge, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-diff-zero, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-zero, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-ball, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer-mfderiv, lem:dc-ch8-2-2-semiconjugacy}\n\n  \\dcref{ch8:2.3}\n  Let $M$ be a space of constant curvature and let $p$ and $q$ be any two points of\n  $M$. Let $\\{e_j\\}$ and $\\{f_j\\}$ be arbitrary orthonormal bases of $T_p(M)$ and\n  $T_q(M)$, respectively. Then there exist neighborhoods $U$ of $p$ and $V$ of $q$,\n  and an isometry $g:U\\to V$ such that $dg_p(e_j)=f_j$.\n\n\\end{corollary}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n  \\uses{cor:dc-ch8-2-2}\n\\sketch\n  Apply \\cref{cor:dc-ch8-2-2} with $\\tilde M=M$ and $\\tilde p=q$, taking for $i$ the linear\n  isometry $T_pM\\to T_qM$ carrying $e_j$ to $f_j$.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Corollary</div></section>[Local frame transitivity] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-636f723a64632d6368382d322d33\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature%23lem%3Adc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-transfer-const\">↗ lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-transfer-const</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo